Experimental shared-memory separable Mitchell convolution.
Reuses libplacebo's existing filter generation, LUT and sampler infrastructure.
Original libplacebo authors and LGPL-2.1-or-later licensing remain applicable.
Apply manually after the fork's libplacebo patches; not applied by Dockerfile.

